{"path":"/zh/concepts/external-acceptance-probe/","title":"外部验收探针：从用户一侧裁决成功","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-8e6524c620562811-1","revision":"8e6524c62056281191d08ca2c8354df32cbdbc7a77e65f2d30b28418bd7df956","tag":"p","quote":"GeoServer 可能在 HTTP 200 响应中返回 ServiceException。发布接口报告成功，用户打开地图仍然看到空白。只看进程退出码或状态码，会把业务失败记成成功。"},{"block_id":"adps-f2708629a09df624-1","revision":"f2708629a09df624c52e40d60fbb1fb161cfe40ab227f68ca9397cb30595484a","tag":"p","quote":"外部验收探针从系统边界外执行与用户交付物一致的动作，并同时检查返回状态、内容和可见结果。系统内部回执属于过程证据；探针结果决定任务提交、重试或失败。"},{"block_id":"adps-e0385962c855f194-1","revision":"e0385962c855f1944720376ed8c35bcd595a94962cca6074545ddd4cbe02fd1b","tag":"p","quote":"玄宿案例的探针发送真实 WMS / WMTS 请求，检查内容类型与异常正文，并验证截图包含非透明地图内容。结论写入 verify_report.json。"},{"block_id":"adps-7818a7b15ef16449-1","revision":"7818a7b15ef16449acbbcf3fdf62d310b4142997af4b2d51187b24af77c3e626","tag":"p","quote":"探针应覆盖用户真正依赖的路径，避免调用内部捷径。视觉检查可能受底图、阈值和数据类型影响，需要已知良好样本与回归校准。复杂制图语义仍可能需要人工抽检。"},{"block_id":"adps-ebc1cb5aec1e5258-1","revision":"ebc1cb5aec1e52585694353db43c7a7ebf1f5af90a7f3392a6daae02d601376a","tag":"li","quote":"初始案例：玄宿科技 GIS 数据发布 Agent，案例提供熊钰柯（Yuke Xiong）。"},{"block_id":"adps-3625c982ab9691dd-1","revision":"3625c982ab9691dd6e186ea76cc53d56d52e58af42ced71afe482d88df8e72c8","tag":"li","quote":"历史近邻：end-to-end test、synthetic probe、health endpoint monitoring。"},{"block_id":"adps-08368396afcec7db-1","revision":"08368396afcec7dbcd34676921785709c11f0ff23ffcc7e38bbd418b04feadcf","tag":"li","quote":"ADPS 整理：把外部探针回执接入任务状态机，直接裁决副作用是否提交。"},{"block_id":"adps-743b4de8c8fad102-1","revision":"743b4de8c8fad1025fec60b82cbc3451ba186867670e02df78b604cf3bd9eb89","tag":"li","quote":"定义地位：ADPS 重述。"},{"block_id":"adps-c04f929401613946-1","revision":"c04f92940161394663ccdc8b2c376af7bf1ee7de19b5252dd73db4a1410709c1","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：玄宿科技 GIS 数据发布 Agent 案例报告；案例提供：熊钰柯（Yuke Xiong）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
